🌌 Urban Dark Sky Loss & Light Pollution Intelligence Dashboard

> A Power BI end-to-end analytics project tracking light pollution, sky quality degradation, wildlife disruption, and dark sky recovery initiatives across 13 global cities (2018–2023).



 📌 Why This Project?

Over 80% of the world's population now lives under light-polluted skies. This project quantifies that crisis — translating sky brightness readings, Bortle classifications, wildlife mortality data, and city-level policy actions into a single intelligence dashboard.

This is **not a sales or finance dashboard**. It uses real-world scientific metrics (SQM, mcd/m², Bortle class) that demonstrate domain knowledge in environmental analytics, a growing field in ESG reporting and sustainability consulting.

## 🗂️ Project Structure

```
lightpollution-powerbi/
│
├── data/
│   ├── city_light_pollution.csv        # Core dataset: SQM, Bortle, energy, CO₂
│   ├── wildlife_impact.csv             # Bird deaths, insect decline, sea turtle disruption
│   ├── dark_sky_initiatives.csv        # LED conversion %, policy status, energy saved
│   └── bortle_scale_reference.csv      # Lookup table: Bortle classes 1–9
│
├── dax/
│   └── all_measures.dax                # All DAX: columns, measures, time intelligence, scenarios
│
├── dashboard/
│   └── dashboard_preview.png           # Dashboard screenshot for GitHub README
│
└── README.md                           # This file
```

