## 🌐 Real-World Extensions

- Connect to the **Globe at Night API** for live SQM readings
- Add **satellite VIIRS imagery** via Azure Maps for spatial light pollution layers
- Build an **automated refresh** pipeline using Power BI Dataflows + Azure Data Factory
- Extend to **500+ cities** using the Light Pollution Map API (lightpollutionmap.info)

